# The first three minutes of a new seed-1 game, unscripted: nothing calmed,
# nothing spawned, no teleports. Wake, gather down on the strand by walking
# and pressing E, walk out into the fields, and meet what the land puts there
# (workers on their rounds, and the first meeting, a runner seen on its round
# before it notices). It must end with the player on their feet:
#   TOUR_TIMEOUT=300 tools/tour.sh tours/wild.tour --fail-downed
#
wait 2.4
shot 01-wake
# Down to the driftwood on the strand below the village, pressing E when it is close.
walk -0.92,0.40 1.0
try 8
walk -0.92,0.40 0.1
press use 0.1
await took 1.6
end
shot 02-gathered-on-the-strand
# Up through the village and out along the road east, into the coast fields.
walk 1,-0.25 3.5
shot 03-through-the-village
walk 1,-0.25 3.5
shot 04-out-along-the-road
# Dead wood under the trees beside the road, while the land goes about its work.
try 10
walk 1,0 0.15
press use 0.1
await took 1.6
end
shot 04b-dead-wood
walk 1,0.2 3.0
# Standing out in the fields, watching the land go about its work (a worker
# crossing on its round), while the game's first minute or so passes.
wait 6
shot 05-watching
wait 6
shot 06-watching
wait 6
shot 07-watching
wait 6
shot 08-watching
wait 6
shot 09-watching
wait 6
shot 10-watching
# The first meeting comes out about now (75 s in), a runner on its round in
# view, not yet noticing the player: frames while it comes along.
#
# THE WATCH ENDS WHEN IT LOOKS UP. This stood still for 13.6 s of fixed `wait`
# and failed about one run in three, because sometimes the runner noticed and
# downed a player who was doing nothing — and every frame after it noticed was
# also a lie about its own name. `until noticed` is what a player does: watch
# while it is still on its round, and stop watching the moment it has you.
await mob 60
shot 11-on-its-round with on_round
# ...and then the watch runs on until it looks up, or until it has walked its
# round past us, which is the other thing a worker does. Neither is claimed,
# because neither can be promised: the frame after this one is named for the
# watching, not for what is in it.
until noticed 20
shot 12-watching-it-work
# It has noticed, and comes: read the tell, round to its back, strike, strike.
await tell 60
shot 13-its-tell with mob
try 12
await tell 8
walkto part 1.3
tap swing
wait 0.45
tap swing
await killed 0.6
end
wait 0.4
shot 18-won
wait 3
shot 19-on-our-feet
